## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
Severity: MEDIUM  
NVDA is fab-lite, dependent on foundries like GF and TSMC, exposing it to supply chain risks. Its heavy reliance on data center customers (e.g., AWS, Azure) creates concentration risk. While its AI and cloud leadership mitigate some risks, the company faces inventory digestion challenges in a slowing capex cycle.  

